# Clean-room agent environment (/opt/depa/agent): the depa SDK (provides `depa-ccr`) with the
# AWS extra for S3 federation, plus the light depa-train core the agent imports to validate
# recipes against contracts. Compile from the repository root:
#   uv pip compile ccr/requirements/agent.in -o ccr/requirements/agent.txt -p 3.12 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --generate-hashes \
#     --no-emit-package depa --no-emit-package depa-train --emit-index-url
./sdk/python[aws]
./trainers
